re is no clock skew (the arrival event and the nearest fix share the 13:31:56 timestamp); the chat log holds exactly the 2 messages trip_record.chat_message_count records; and the fare line reconciles to the net SGD 4.50 figure.\n\nConfidence is 0.95. The facts that decide the case — the 144-second dwell, the 180-second free waiting period and the 13:34:24 cancellation — are carried by artifacts at weight_multiplier 1.0 (EV-GPS-02707 and EV-TRIP-02707), so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.00. The missing advisory EV-ADVIS-02707-01 (weight 0.0) carries none of the deciding facts: POL-NS-06(i) is unavailable against a MISSING advisory, and in any event the trace shows a single in-geofence interval, so there is nothing to accumulate.\n\nThe monetary effect, SGD 4.50, is below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold in POL-GEN-05, so this provisional ruling executes automatically, subject to the appeal route under POL-GEN-04."
